{"pageProps":{"subjectPageLayoutProps":{"basePath":"/ib-math/analysis-and-approaches-hl","subject":{"id":"ac4bdd2b-7675-4c0d-93df-b4e042559932","name":"Analysis & Approaches HL","short_name":"AA HL","description":null,"slug":"analysis-and-approaches-hl","formula_booklet_label":"Formula Sheet","status":"published","questionbank_status":"visible","keyconcepts_status":"visible","practiceexams_status":"visible","pastpapers_status":"visible","casestudies_status":"new","notes_status":"new","case_studies_label":"Paper 3","case_studies_description":"This resource provides two collections of extended-response questions for IB Mathematics: Analysis and Approaches HL Paper 3. Our IB Exam-Style Questions, created by experienced IB math teachers and examiners, simulate actual Paper 3 format and difficulty. They combine multiple topics in unfamiliar contexts to develop problem-solving, modeling, and investigative skills. Our Topic-Specific Questions focus on individual AA syllabus subtopics, for targeted practice as you learn new content throughout the course.","case_studies_description_short":"This resource offers a collection of mathematical modeling and investigation-style questions designed to help you prepare for the IB Math AA HL Paper 3 exam. ","key_concepts_label":null,"key_concepts_description":null,"key_concepts_description_short":null,"questionbank_label":null,"questionbank_description":null,"questionbank_description_short":null,"practiceexams_label":null,"practiceexams_description_short":null,"bootcamp_status":"new","bootcamps_label":"Bootcamps & IA Toolkit","bootcamps_description":"This resource combines Bootcamps and an IA Toolkit to support students throughout the IB Mathematics course. Our Bootcamps are carefully sequenced, intensive workshops designed by experienced IB Math teachers to review the key concepts, techniques, and problem-solving skills needed to achieve a 7. Our IA Toolkit provides structured guidance for the Internal Assessment, including how to get